{"title":"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_15\">Problem 15</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 15\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the number of integer sequences <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/f/cdf8a7c20cc9a9127e10dd6afa98d7fce2c4066f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"11\" /> such that\n</p>\n<dl><dd>(1) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/96393d6cfdad792d536eb9a366d62f0d3d4fa354.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le a_1 &lt; 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/1/0b1906220dcb6b4c6fd3edb11f06fdfa921af96f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 \\le a_6 &lt; 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" />,</dd>\n<dd>(2) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/3/b339d77c7ade085f657e76933a62d7bd18f25be0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le a_{k+1}-a_k &lt; 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/4/cc4ee3ce81b4cc538bb3c0b215a2ab87e0cd160b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le k &lt; 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, and</dd>\n<dd>(3) there do not exist <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/9/7c97b6ab4c770b37f92cdbecc45f2c38bd2424c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le i &lt; j \\le 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88d103aeafb832480f56722830d4518a889e0663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_j-a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.</dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/f/2afd76793df5790b582b3ed9cdcff577aea884b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$302$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I\" title=\"2020 CIME I\">2020 CIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 CIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\"